dex（AI 代理）","model":null},{"id":"t-wu060-t-wu060-heqi22","person_id":"713_glb_bhv","kind":"office","title":"蘄春太守","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"本句所載職官，任免時間未詳。","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-060","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-060-heqi","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-060-heqi","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-060-heqi:line029","quote":"　　初，晉宗為戲口將，以眾叛如魏，還為蘄春太守，圖襲安樂，取其保質。權以為恥忿，因軍初罷，六月盛夏、出其不意，詔齊督麋芳、鮮于丹等襲蘄春，遂生虜宗。後四年卒，子達及弟景皆有令名，為佳將。","person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-060-heqi:line029:m0004"}],"attestations":[{"id":"t-wu060-t-wu060-heqi22:a","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-060-heqi:line029","person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-060-heqi:line029:m0004","start":19,"end":23,"surface":"蘄春太守","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"human_reviewed":false,"reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","model":null},{"id":"t-wu062-t-wu062-huzong9","person_id":"713_glb_bhv","kind":"office","title":"蘄春太守","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"本句所載職官，任免時間未詳。","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-062","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-062-huzong","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-062-huzong","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-062-huzong:line022","quote":"　　胡綜字偉則。汝南固始人也。少孤，母將避難江東。孫策領會稽太守，綜年十四，為門下循行，留吳與孫權共讀書。策薨，權為討虜將軍，以綜為金曹從事，從討黃祖，拜鄂長。權為將軍，都京，召綜還，為書部。與是儀、徐詳俱典軍國密事。劉備下白帝，權以見兵少，使綜料諸縣，得六千人，立解煩兩部，詳領左部、綜領右部督。吳將晉宗叛歸魏，魏以宗為蘄春太守，去江數百里，數為寇害。權使綜與賀齊輕行掩襲，生虜得宗。加建武中郎將。魏拜權為吳王，封綜、儀、詳皆為亭侯。","person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-062-huzong:line022:m0151"}],"attestations":[{"id":"t-wu062-t-wu062-huzong9:a","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-062-huzong:line022","person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-062-huzong:line022:m0151","start":161,"end":165,"surface":"蘄春太守","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"human_reviewed":false,"reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","model":null}],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-047-sun-quan:p051","text":"　　二年春正月，曹眞分軍據江陵中州。是月，城江夏山。改四分，用《乾象歷》。三月，曹仁遣將軍常彫等，以兵五千，乘油船，晨渡濡須中州。仁子泰因引軍急攻朱桓，桓兵拒之。遣將軍嚴圭等擊破彫等。是月，魏軍皆退。夏四月，權群臣勸即尊號，權不許。劉備薨於白帝。五月，曲阿言甘露降。先是戲口守將晉宗殺將王直，以眾叛如魏，魏以爲蘄春太守，數犯邊境。六月，權令將軍賀齊、糜芳、劉邵等襲蘄春，邵等生虜宗。冬十一月，蜀使中郎將鄧芝來聘。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":61,"last_line":61,"raw_start":10817,"raw_end":11770,"raw_character_offsets":[10817,10818,10819,10820,10821,10822,10823,10824,10825,10826,10827,10828,10829,10837,10838,10841,10842,10843,10844,10845,10846,10847,10848,10849,10850,10851,10852,10853,10854,10855,10856,10857,10865,10866,10867,10870,10871,10975,10976,10977,10985,10986,10989,10990,10991,10992,10993,10994,10995,10996,10997,10998,10999,11000,11001,11002,11003,11004,11005,11006,11007,11008,11009,11010,11011,11012,11013,11021,11024,11025,11026,11027,11028,11031,11034,11035,11036,11037,11038,11039,11040,11041,11042,11043,11044,11045,11046,11047,11048,11049,11050,11051,11052,11053,11054,11055,11056,11057,11058,11059,11060,11061,11062,11063,11064,11065,11066,11067,11068,11069,11070,11071,11072,11073,11074,11075,11241,11242,11243,11244,11245,11246,11247,11614,11615,11616,11617,11618,11619,11620,11621,11622,11623,11624,11625,11626,11627,11628,11629,11637,11638,11641,11642,11643,11644,11645,11646,11647,11648,11649,11650,11651,11652,11653,11654,11655,11656,11657,11658,11659,11660,11661,11662,11663,11664,11665,11666,11667,11668,11669,11670,11671,11672,11673,11674,11675,11676,11677,11678,11679,11680,11681,11682,11683,11684,11685,11686,11687,11688,11689,11690,11691,11692,11693,11694,11695,11696,11697,11698,11699,11700,11708,11709,11712,11713,11714],"revision_id":2602668},"mentio